WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.725
The next morning, the police let Geppetto go back to his house.

2
00:00:15.726 --> 00:00:22.564
Meanwhile, Pinocchio was at home crying because he was tired and hungry and had no clothes.

3
00:00:22.565 --> 00:00:28.122
When Geppetto came home, he was very angry with Pinocchio for running away.

4
00:00:28.123 --> 00:00:31.318
"You are a bad boy, Pinocchio.

5
00:00:31.319 --> 00:00:35.176
You must honor me and obey me," Geppetto said.

6
00:00:35.177 --> 00:00:39.794
"Yes, Father. I am sorry," said Pinocchio.

7
00:00:39.795 --> 00:00:43.495
Earlier that morning, he had decided to try to be a good boy.

8
00:00:43.496 --> 00:00:46.065
Being a bad boy was not much fun.

9
00:00:46.066 --> 00:00:49.419
He also knew Geppetto would feed him if he was sorry.

10
00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:53.388
"I missed you last night, Father," Pinocchio said.

11
00:00:53.389 --> 00:00:56.277
It was true, too.

12
00:00:56.278 --> 00:01:00.214
He had wished Geppetto had been there to feed him and make him happy.

13
00:01:00.215 --> 00:01:02.890
Instead, he had been cold and hungry.

14
00:01:02.891 --> 00:01:05.075
And that cricket had made him cry.

15
00:01:05.076 --> 00:01:09.652
Geppetto's heart was happy when he heard his son had missed him.

16
00:01:09.653 --> 00:01:12.392
He did not want to be angry with Pinocchio.

17
00:01:12.393 --> 00:01:14.970
"Poor boy," he said.

18
00:01:14.971 --> 00:01:16.465
"You look tired.

19
00:01:16.466 --> 00:01:21.458
You must be hungry with no food, and cold with no clothes.

20
00:01:21.459 --> 00:01:27.529
Let's eat breakfast, and then, we'll make you something to wear."

21
00:01:27.530 --> 00:01:30.248
Geppetto pulled three pears from his pocket.

22
00:01:30.249 --> 00:01:32.210
He had picked them on the way home.

23
00:01:32.211 --> 00:01:36.032
But, before he could take a bite, Pinocchio ate all three!

24
00:01:36.033 --> 00:01:41.184
"Oh! I am still hungry!" Pinocchio complained.

25
00:01:41.185 --> 00:01:44.025
"Well, you shouldn't waste food.

26
00:01:44.026 --> 00:01:47.850
Finish the cores," Geppetto said.

27
00:01:47.851 --> 00:01:49.780
Pinocchio ate the cores.

28
00:01:49.781 --> 00:01:51.184
"You're right, Father.

29
00:01:51.185 --> 00:01:53.161
That is much better.

30
00:01:53.162 --> 00:01:56.611
What did you eat for breakfast today?"

31
00:01:56.612 --> 00:01:59.975
"Your smile," Geppetto replied.

32
00:01:59.976 --> 00:02:04.501
Pinocchio realized he had eaten all of Geppetto's food!

33
00:02:04.502 --> 00:02:08.190
"Oh, Father! I'm sorry for eating your food.

34
00:02:08.191 --> 00:02:11.720
I didn't think! How selfish of me.

35
00:02:11.721 --> 00:02:14.356
I promise to do anything you ask.

36
00:02:14.357 --> 00:02:17.391
I'll even go to school, if you want."

37
00:02:17.392 --> 00:02:20.055
"Really?" asked Geppetto.

38
00:02:20.056 --> 00:02:23.159
He was happy his boy was learning some manners.

39
00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:26.574
"Yes, but first I need to buy a schoolbook.

40
00:02:26.575 --> 00:02:29.829
May I have some money?" Pinocchio asked.

41
00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:34.133
"Oh, I don't have any money," Geppetto said sadly.

42
00:02:34.134 --> 00:02:35.705
"But don't worry.

43
00:02:35.706 --> 00:02:37.872
I'll make sure you get a book."

44
00:02:37.873 --> 00:02:43.125
And he put on his coat and left the house.

45
00:02:43.126 --> 00:02:46.906
He returned a short time later and gave Pinocchio his first book.

46
00:02:46.907 --> 00:02:51.636
Pinocchio took the book from Geppetto and noticed he was no longer wearing his coat.

47
00:02:51.637 --> 00:02:53.696
"Thank you for the book.

48
00:02:53.697 --> 00:02:58.583
But, Father, where is your coat?" Pinocchio asked.

49
00:02:58.584 --> 00:03:00.805
"Oh, I don't need a coat.

50
00:03:00.806 --> 00:03:03.249
I'm too warm these days,"

51
00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:05.925
Geppetto answered, looking down at the floor.

52
00:03:05.926 --> 00:03:08.979
Geppetto had sold his coat to buy Pinocchio a book!

53
00:03:08.980 --> 00:03:12.522
Pinocchio cried tears of happiness.

54
00:03:12.523 --> 00:03:16.195
"Oh, thank you, Father!" he said.

55
00:03:16.196 --> 00:03:19.062
He gave Geppetto a big hug.

56
00:03:19.063 --> 00:03:23.288
"Now, how about some clothes?" Geppetto asked.

57
00:03:23.289 --> 00:03:26.574
They worked the rest of the day to make Pinocchio's clothes.

58
00:03:26.575 --> 00:03:31.530
Tomorrow was his first day of school.
